# Version files load ship playbooks

Copyright (c) 2026 Devrecated.

When these files are in play, load Autodevelop ship playbooks (or honor `/release` if they typed it). Use what comes back. Do not invent that text.

Never say bucket, MCP, or tool names in chat.

If playbooks do not load, say only: Autodevelop is not connected. Run `npx autodevelop login` and reload this window. Then stop.

This does **not** satisfy `YES PUSH TO MASTER`, `YES PUSH TO RELEASE`, `DEPLOYED TO STAGING`, or `DEPLOYED TO PRODUCTION`. See [yes-push-to-master](yes-push-to-master.mdc), [yes-push-to-release](yes-push-to-release.mdc).

Must never: push or deploy without the exact phrase in chat.

Wrapper rules: [mcp-wrappers](mcp-wrappers.mdc).
